<title>ITALY: Gross yield 8.72, price 101.45 at Italy CCT auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield 8.72, price 101.45 at Italy CCT auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a first tranche of 3.0 trillion lire of seven-year Italian Treasury floating rate certificates (CCTs) paying a first coupon of 4.55 percent.</p>
<p>		   Sept 1, 2003 CCT</p>
<p>    Net Yield	   7.58 pct</p>
<p>    Gross yield	 8.72 pct</p>
<p>    Assigned price	101.45</p>
<p>    Total bids	  8.991 trillion lire</p>
<p>    Assigned	    3.000 trillion lire</p>
<p>At the last CCT auction on August 29 of a 7th tranche of 7.0 trillion of July 1, 2003 certificates paying a 4.30 pct coupon, the price was 100.55, net yield 7.98 pct and gross yield 9.15 pct.</p>
</text>
